Package: uoo-boot-manager
Version: 2.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Uoo Boot Manager contributors <uoo@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.6), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), polkitd | policykit-1, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: grub2-common, efibootmgr
Description: Native desktop manager for Ubuntu boot settings
 Manage GRUB menus, custom boot entries, one-time boot choices, UEFI firmware
 options, backups, and supported bootloader repair on Ubuntu.
 System changes use an authenticated helper and include backups.
